~ greeting
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Val: hi!
if Global.val_meter <= Global.ONE_HEART:
	=> one_heart
elif Global.val_meter <= Global.TWO_HEARTS:
	=> two_hearts
=> END
~ one_heart
%
	Val: I had a pomegranate for the first time yesterday!
	$> Global.expression = "elated"
	Val: it was really good - you should try one!
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Val: they're in season!
	$> Global.expression = "unsure"
	Val: I think...
	$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
	Val: I heard that from somewhere, I swear!
	- this is really your first time having one?
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: ...
		$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
		Val: AHH, DON'T JUDGE ME!!
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: it's - there's
		$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
		Val: THERE'S A FIRST TIME FOR EVERYTHING!!
		$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
		Val: I'm just letting you know 'cause it was so scrumptious and beautiful
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: I didn't expect such judgement!
		- chill, I wasn't judging you
			$>  Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS * 2)
			$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
			Val: suree... 
		- haha, sorry for judging you
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
			Val: ok then... you're forgiven 
	- I've had one before
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Val: omg really!!
		Val: how was it? 
		- it was kinda gross
			$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
			Val: EHH, REALLY?
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Val: you just haven't had a good one then!
			$> Global.expression = "elated" 
			Val: ok, remind me to bring you one tomorrow
			$> Global.expression = "happy" 
			Val: the one's at my house right now are so good
		- it was delicious
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			$> Global.expression = "elated" 
			Val: hell yea I know right!!
			$> Global.expression = "happy" 
			Val: if you ever want some, let me know
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Val: I think I could spare a few for you 
	- ok, I'll try one
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		$> Global.expression = "elated" 
		Val: YES 
		Val: send me a pic of it when you do!
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Val: make sure you get a good one too!
% 
	$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
	Val: ...
	Val: umm, how are you?
	- bad
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Val: damn, who hurt you lol?
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: wait, did someone actually hurt you? 
		$> Global.expression = "elated" 
		Val: I can beat them up for you if you want?
		- with what?
			$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
			Val: HEY
			$> Global.expression = "angry" 
			Val: I've been to the gym before!
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			VaL: don't you see these muscles
			: ...
			$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
			Val: damn... I see how it is
			$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
			Val: wait, don't tell me it's about my height again
			$> Global.expression = "angry" 
			Val: I'M AVERAGE
			$> Global.expression = "angry" 
			Val: Y'ALL ARE JUST TALL
			Val: ...
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Val: fine, I'll give them a good headbutt then!
		- no one hurt me
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Val: ok! but let me know if there ever is!
			$> Global.expression = "elated" 
			Val: I'm gonna back you up
		- thank you!
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Val: no problem! just say the word haha
	- good
		$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		Val: that's good... 
		$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
		Val: I'm good too 

=> questions
=> END


~ two_hearts
%
	$> Global.expression = "surprised"
	Val: AHH I have a test next period
	- did you study
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Val: ...
		Val: that's... irrelevant
		- you have no one to blame but yourself
			$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.expression = "angry"
			Val: ...
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			Val: MANN I can't even argue with that
			Val: I don't get how people do it
			$> Global.expression = "unsure"
			Val: like, people like Christine who can just, lock in when they need to lock in
			$> Global.expression = "angry"
			Val: I always tell myself I'm gonna study, for at least ONE HOUR
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			Val: and I still procrastinate on that, till I'm back where I was before
			$> Global.expression = "unsure"
			Val: at least THIS test isn't worth anything, but I'm actually gonna be screwed when it is...
			- are you making excuses right now?
				$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
				$> Global.expression = "angry"
				Val: I'm not, it's a real struggle!
				$> Global.expression = "unsure"
				Val: don't tell me you've NEVER procrastinated in your life?
				- sounds like a skill issue
					$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
					$> Global.expression = "surprised"
					Val: DAMN
					$> Global.expression = "unsure"
					Val: ok, I see how it is
					$> Global.expression = "laugh"
					Val: you'll see Violet, I'm gonna channel my inner Christine 
					Val: 100% for the rest of the year!
				- I have...
					$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
					$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
					$> Global.expression = "laugh"
					Val: HAH 
					$> Global.expression = "unsure"
					Val: that's what I thought - 
					$> Global.expression = "unsure"
					Val: so you have no right to judge 
			- I find it hard to as well
				$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
				$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
				$> Global.expression = "elated"
				Val: yes! thank you
				$> Global.expression = "laugh"
				Val: at least we're suffering together
				
		- I can help you study... right now, if you want?
			$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS * 3)
			$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
			$> Global.expression = "surprised"
			Val: no way! really?
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			Val: you'd do that for me
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Val: wait, let me get my stuff out
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Val: thank you so much!
	- good luck!
		$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Val: thanks!
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Val: ...I'm gonna need it haha...
=> questions


~ questions
$> Global.expression = "happy" 
Val: ...
- compliment (33% success rate)
	% => good
	%2 => bad
- joke (50% success rate)
	% => joke_good
	% => joke_bad
- open up [if Global.val_meter > Global.FOUR_HEARTS]
- end convo
=> END

~ good
Val: ...  
$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS * 2)
$> Global.expression = "sad" 
Val: aww, Violet
$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
Val: don't look - I'm blushing right now!!
=> bell
=> END

~ bad
Val: ... 
$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS * 2)
$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS * 2
$> Global.expression = "angry" 
Val: excuse me?
$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
Val: I'm gonna pretend I didn't hear that
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_good
Val: ...
$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
$> Global.add_meter(Global.HEART_POINTS)
Val: HAHHHAHAHA
Val: Oh shoot, didn't mean to laugh that loud... haha
Val: if we get yelled at, it's your fault 
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_bad
Val: ...
$> Global.expression = "angry" 
$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.val_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
$> Global.happiness -= Global.HAPPY_POINTS * 2
Val: ?? 
$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
Val: ohhhh, that's what you meant!
Val: bruh, that was so corny
Val: you can do better than that...
=> bell
=> END

~ bell
$> Global.expression = "unsure"
Val: ahh, ms is staring at us...
Val: let's lock in!
=> END